    "m2_prompt_trader_proposal_original": "**Action**: Hold\n\n**Reasoning**: The evidence supports maintaining current positioning rather than initiating new trades. The technical setup is genuinely mixed: deeply oversold conditions (RSI 28.84, price below lower Bollinger Band) and proximity to the 200-day SMA at $177.50 suggest mean-reversion potential, but the bearish momentum structure (price below 10 EMA, 50 SMA, and Bollinger middle band with expanding negative MACD at -2.02) argues against high-conviction buying. Critically, the fundamental picture is incomplete \u2014 no income statement data is available to verify revenue, margins, or EPS, so the bull case rests solely on backward-looking FY2023 cash flow. With no stabilization signal confirmed and the 200 SMA support razor-thin at just $1.50 below price, the prudent action is to hold at neutral weight, set a protective stop at $177.00 for existing holders, and wait for confirmation (reclaim of $180-181 zone, contracting MACD, or RSI turning up) before committing new capital.\n\n**Stop Loss**: 177.0\n\n**Position Sizing**: Maintain neutral weight; no new positions at current levels. If adding, starter position only.\n\nFINAL TRANSACTION PROPOSAL: **HOLD**",
